{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2026-07", "window": 4, "start_date": 1784851200, "end_date": 1785542399, "month_true_total": 259, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:58:18 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "231768656", "author": {"steamid": "76561199016994875", "personaname": "Moe98x", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199016994875/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2670, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2552, "last_played": 1785537992, "avatar": "147c40cdeab0d7819957667647d9b88223d98007"}, "language": "english", "review": "Remnant 2 isn't a game I would recommend for its story. The story is okay at best and never really grabbed my attention.\r\n\r\nWhat kept me playing was the gameplay. The combat is fun, the bosses are challenging, and the build variety gives you plenty of ways to play. Every new weapon, archetype, and build feels rewarding to discover.\r\n\r\nWhere the game truly shines is in co-op. Playing with teammates completely changes the experience. Fighting difficult bosses together, reviving each other during intense encounters, and experimenting with different class combinations makes every session memorable. The game feels like it was designed with co-op in mind, and that's where I had the most fun. Many reviewers and players highlight the co-op experience as one of the game's strongest features.\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for an amazing story, this may not be the game for you. But if you enjoy challenging gameplay and want a great co-op experience with friends, Remnant 2 is absolutely worth playing.\r\n\r\nStory: 6/10\r\nGameplay: 9/10\r\nCo-op Fun: 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1785530613, "timestamp_updated": 1785530613, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231754528", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976386346", "personaname": "Wolfy Wet Furr", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wolfywetfurr/", "num_games_owned": 574, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 20231, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20231, "last_played": 1766117271, "avatar": "994e401e2f2e0f02b5649e9ed5f7d9b37549eaa2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Easily my favorite third person action rpg experience that preserved what I liked most about the first game, and expanded on it with so much more for me to enjoy. It's the most I've personally invested in a game's build crafting and mechanics in general and I love the world building.", "timestamp_created": 1785516616, "timestamp_updated": 1785516616, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231742551", "author": {"steamid": "76561199477574071", "personaname": "suruptic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199477574071/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 6838, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2328, "last_played": 1787132247, "avatar": "addd66055bcd57bee0c0f8d1b681acee848f62a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "worth a play", "timestamp_created": 1785505211, "timestamp_updated": 1785505211, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_r